tain current confirmation rather than treat this exercise note as evidence about TICC."]]},"created_time":1789189352709,"last_edited_time":1789189352709,"parent_id":"3ba0b700-541e-81d0-af55-dc1a8f49f5af","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"fdc836a5-354a-4ab4-a5ed-4952465c677a","crdt_format_version":1,"crdt_data":{"title":{"r":"DSEkNq5YGMDVV_fXDiQG5g,\"start\",\"end\"","n":{"DSEkNq5YGMDVV_fXDiQG5g,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"DSEkNq5YGMDVV_fXDiQG5g","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"t","i":["T-Wly4Yljr4h",1],"o":"start","l":500,"c":"For this case, venue coordination confirms step-free access between the 4F accessible elevators, audience area, V.I.P. Room and accessible restroom. The public floor plan supplies spatial locators; it does not prove today's elevator operation, unobstructed route, seating configuration or acoustic performance. Those case conditions are supplied by this fictional coordination record, and a real deployment must obtain current confirmation rather than treat this exercise note as evidence about TICC."},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"2fdefb04-6881-4c55-8302-3822705b5a45":{"value":{"value":{"id":"2fdefb04-6881-4c55-8302-3822705b5a45","version":5,"type":"text","properties":{"title":[["The package includes setup and teardown access, the quiet space and its separation from the programme. QuietWorks supplies staffing under Q-010; ClearText supplies captions under Q-005. Q-003/Q-004 catering and Q-006/Q-007 AV are fictional TICC-coordinated service offers, not permission to bring external food or equipment. StreamNorth Q-008 still requires its stated network test and venue confirmation before use. The exercise record confirms adequate captioning, hearing-loop and allergy coordination for the base plan using Q-004/Q-005/Q-006/Q-010; both catering options include an Operations-coordinated dietary response for the 28 vegetarian meals, 12 halal meals and four severe-allergy requests. Named contacts are held by Operations; the learner records the response state without inventing or publishing personal medical details. The two menus differ in capacity and cost, not in whether safety may be ignored."]]},"created_time":1789189352709,"last_edited_time":1789189352709,"parent_id":"3ba0b700-541e-81d0-af55-dc1a8f49f5af","parent_table":"block","alive":true,"space_id":"fdc836a5-354a-4ab4-a5ed-4952465c677a","crdt_format_version":1,"crdt_data":{"title":{"r":"rdZezGXlxPP_Fu_psgyxqA,\"start\",\"end\"","n":{"rdZezGXlxPP_Fu_psgyxqA,\"start\",\"end\"":{"s":{"x":"rdZezGXlxPP_Fu_psgyxqA","i":[{"t":"s"},{"t":"t","i":["zIcdlBFGk1QO",1],"o":"start","l":921,"c":"The package includes setup and teardown access, the quiet space and its separation from the programme. QuietWorks supplies staffing under Q-010; ClearText supplies captions under Q-005. Q-003/Q-004 catering and Q-006/Q-007 AV are fictional TICC-coordinated service offers, not permission to bring external food or equipment. StreamNorth Q-008 still requires its stated network test and venue confirmation before use. The exercise record confirms adequate captioning, hearing-loop and allergy coordination for the base plan using Q-004/Q-005/Q-006/Q-010; both catering options include an Operations-coordinated dietary response for the 28 vegetarian meals, 12 halal meals and four severe-allergy requests. Named contacts are held by Operations; the learner records the response state without inventing or publishing personal medical details. The two menus differ in capacity and cost, not in whether safety may be ignored."},{"t":"e"}],"l":""},"c":[]}}}}},"role":"reader"}},"f58c12b1-089e-42b8-974c-4dd2305d3f26":{"value":{"value":{"id":"f58c12b1-089e-42b8-974c-4dd2305d3f26","version":5,"type":"text","properties":{"title":[["No booking or spend has been approved. Operations receives the versioned plan, selected date/room, headcount policy, per-option hard-constraint results and unresolved issues. Budget owners receive their category cost, remaining ceiling and cited quote validi